From 675e0bec2e2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hemang Kumawat <HemangKumawat@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:43:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4] arm64: dts: coral: wire s6e3hc2 panel, re-enable MDSS

Reuse flame panel@0 (reset GPIO 67, vddio/vci, TE pinctrl, 4 lanes; same as
stock coral) and change only the compatible. simplefb stays for handover.

Source commit: 675e0bec2e2d (diff against 20203b38f8cb).
Assisted-by: AI agents (Codex, Claude) under the author's direction
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-google-coral.dts | 23 +++++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-google-coral.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-google-coral.dts
index 735eca800dea7ea70843ac325b179d58ebe8da3c..69c045cc88ab0cb640280e4ae017e8450940ec8f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-google-coral.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-google-coral.dts
@@ -8,8 +8,8 @@
  *    are identical to flame. Differences: panel, battery profile, two
  *    microchip,pac1934 power monitors (not described here), audio card name.
  *  - bootloader: 0x9C400000, 0x02400000, "Display Reserved" (same as flame).
- *  - panel: "s6e3hc2 amoled 6.2 cmd mode panel", 1440x3040, DSC. No mainline
- *    driver yet, so the DSI/MDSS path is disabled and we stay on simplefb.
+ *  - panel: "s6e3hc2 amoled 6.2 cmd mode panel", 1440x3040, DSC.
+ *    Driver: drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-samsung-s6e3hc2.c (branch coral-panel).
  */
 
 #include "sm8150-google-flame.dts"
@@ -43,17 +43,16 @@ &battery {
 	energy-full-design-microwatt-hours = <14245000>;
 };
 
-/* ponytail: flame panel (lg,nt37280) is wrong for coral; drop DRM until an s6e3hc2 driver exists */
+/*
+ * Coral panel: Samsung s6e3hc2 (stock qcom,mdss_dsi_s6e3hc2). Same reset GPIO
+ * 67, vddio/vci rails, TE pin and 4 lanes as flame's panel@0, so only the
+ * compatible changes. DSC (slice 720x40, 8 bpc, 8 bpp, 2 slices) lives in
+ * the driver, as mainline panel drivers own their DSC config.
+ */
 &mdss_dsi0 {
-	/delete-node/ panel@0;
-};
-
-&mdss_dsi0_out {
-	/delete-property/ remote-endpoint;
-};
-
-&mdss {
-	status = "disabled";
+	panel@0 {
+		compatible = "samsung,s6e3hc2";
+	};
 };
 
